<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian weekly forex demand plunges to $31.98 mln.</title>
<headline>Nigerian weekly forex demand plunges to $31.98 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigeria's Central Bank on Thursday announced sales of forex at its latest weekly auction held on June 18th:</p>
<p>				     18 June	  11 June Amount sold</p>
<p>$31.981 million $44.345 million Dollar exchange rate 85 naira 85 naira</p>
<p>--Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
